      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-16T18:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hm... I was under the impression that this was the route that the Graphite and Dawn teams has agreed on based on conversations with you, Corentin, and previous docs/comments.\n\nCorentin, what\u0027s your thoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "74c636fe_02c332db",
      "revId": "1603d14fa007d7ca1d12693f67986ef3336f9b61",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
