      "writtenOn": "2026-01-16T20:00:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I could have misunderstood the sentiment. FWIW I think this approach is fine, it has a benefit of not allocating a multi-sampled texture for use as the color attachment that will never get used. It\u0027s also a pretty simple API, minus the validation logic, so it wouldn\u0027t be too hard to change how we trigger MSRTSS in the future.",
      "parentUuid": "053abbb9_684169d7",
      "revId": "1603d14fa007d7ca1d12693f67986ef3336f9b61",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
