      "writtenOn": "2026-01-16T15:56:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we have validation that the sample count must be consistent between all the attachments? Like they must be all 1 (if we don\u0027t allow mixing), or a mix of single sampled and the same sample count (we don\u0027t support other than 4 or 1 so the test could be just a TODO). Also validation that the DS attachment is the correct sample count (or is it MSRTSS as well? In which case we would need a test and to update [1])",
      "revId": "1603d14fa007d7ca1d12693f67986ef3336f9b61",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8f37dafc_5f9c7ec3",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/AttachmentState.cpp",
